{"schema_version": 2, "unit_id": "tag:008C:prose-0001", "parent_tag": "008C", "chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "paragraph", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a continuous map of topological spaces.\nWe will define the pushforward and pullback functors for\npresheaves and sheaves.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nLet <MATH_0002> be a presheaf of sets on <MATH_0003>. We define the\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>pushforward<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> of <MATH_0004> by the rule\n<MATH_0005>\nfor any open <MATH_0006>.\nGiven <MATH_0007> open the restriction map\nis given by the commutativity of the diagram\n<MATHSEG_0001>restriction for <MATHSEG_0002>\nIt is clear that this defines a presheaf of sets. The construction\nis clearly functorial in the presheaf <MATH_0008> and hence\nwe obtain a functor\n<MATH_0009>\n\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "STRUCT_0002": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0003": "\\noindent", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0005": "$$\nf_*\\mathcal{F}(V) = \\mathcal{F}(f^{-1}(V))\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$V \\subset Y$", "MATH_0007": "$V_1 \\subset V_2 \\subset Y$", "MATHSEG_0001": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nf_*\\mathcal{F}(V_2) \\ar[d] \\ar@{=}[r] &\n\\mathcal{F}(f^{-1}(V_2)) \\ar[d]^{\\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "}\\mathcal{F}} \\\\\nf_*\\mathcal{F}(V_1) \\ar@{=}[r] &\n\\mathcal{F}(f^{-1}(V_1))\n}\n$$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0009": "$$\nf_* : \\textit{PSh}(X) \\longrightarrow \\textit{PSh}(Y).\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "math_text_regions": [{"region_id": "math/0001", "delimiter_kind": "display-dollar", "source": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nf_*\\mathcal{F}(V_2) \\ar[d] \\ar@{=}[r] &\n\\mathcal{F}(f^{-1}(V_2)) \\ar[d]^{\\text{restriction for }\\mathcal{F}} \\\\\nf_*\\mathcal{F}(V_1) \\ar@{=}[r] &\n\\mathcal{F}(f^{-1}(V_1))\n}\n$$", "source_hash": "sha256:6e27b3731ed8d51a8efcc93242618f746f650f3d0e7dbe809bff491a1adce99f", "source_byte_span": {"start": 463, "end": 651}, "pieces": [{"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0001"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0002"}], "slots": [{"slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001", "source": "restriction for ", "command": "text", "policy_entry": "p0-frame-sheaves-06", "slot_byte_span": {"start": 93, "end": 109}, "boundary_placeholders": ["MATHSEG_0001", "MATHSEG_0002"], "classification_witness": {"usage": "p0-locked-math-frame", "usage_source": {"before": "{", "after": "\\mathcal", "environments": []}, "source_label": "sheaves-section-presheaves-functorial", "policy_hash": "sha256:71d3aca14a16ed05f2eb0827d4ff6e145236bad3cff1e9e685dc675c059dd357", "anchor": {"source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "file": "sheaves.tex", "owner_tag": "008C", "owner_label": "sheaves-section-presheaves-functorial", "kind": "section", "ordinal": 1, "matches": [{"container_byte_span": {"start": 66985, "end": 67691}, "container_hash": "sha256:053d6ecd85dd8a660fc0e414dae7599c357d3103d8675dddd3789a7867ae34c1", "command_byte_span": {"start": 67380, "end": 67403}, "command_hash": "sha256:c90e53b5283d27ab160eba84cd2648b79e98ef1a7aae32f5929105a6f1700484"}]}}}]}], "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:fe780ec6fdd9761102b0f83902ec3fa5ea7838849162f030ca634e94db003432", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9fab4112c229877c54a4ca3df3c88e20b78268c5866a05321556442723b5902d", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b0b8ab41cd531e7e8166e2a11ac2bff85c43b5abc5ef42ef3cb311d86ff204f6", "source_math_hash": "sha256:60609c34f28d437461e9c2182f9a17f75f30b847b1b4e0b5d3a98f23f8612b7c"}
